Warframe export achievements gotten from:
https://github.com/calamity-inc/warframe-public-export-plus/blob/senpai/ExportAchievements.json


You will need to get your account ID, which is in the form of a 24 character string that is alphanumeric, for example: "12345678abcdefgh12345678"

To get this go to your profile, which should be at: https://www.warframe.com/en/user


The exact steps upon opening the page (and being logged in!) are as follows:
1. Open inspect page
2. Go to the 'Network' secton of the inspector panel
3. Reload the page
4. Find the file called 'user' and click on it to inspect it in detail
5. Navigate to the 'cookies' portion of the request inspector
6. There should be many cookies, you can get your account ID from any of the following:
6A. A cookie named 'gid' has your exact user id in the 'value' field
6B. A cookie named 'user-info' has your exact user id under the key 'user_id' which is in the 'value' field

7. Run WarframeUserDataViewer.cs
8. Enter your user id in the text box and press the button!